WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.285
"I lost my perfect acorn!" cried Kip.

2
00:00:33.286 --> 00:00:42.219
"This is a horrible day."

3
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:46.239
Bird flew over to Kip.

4
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.926
"I'm going to the beach, Kip," said Bird.

5
00:00:49.927 --> 00:00:52.725
"Do you want to come with me?"

6
00:00:52.726 --> 00:00:57.153
"No, thanks, Bird," said Kip sadly.

7
00:00:57.154 --> 00:01:00.314
"What's wrong?" asked Bird.

8
00:01:00.315 --> 00:01:05.852
"This is a horrible day," said Kip.

9
00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:11.064
"I lost my perfect acorn."

10
00:01:11.065 --> 00:01:15.392
"Oh, don't worry," said Bird.

11
00:01:15.393 --> 00:01:18.810
"You'll find another perfect acorn."

12
00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:29.010
Bird flew off.

13
00:01:29.011 --> 00:01:32.769
"Bird is right," thought Kip.

14
00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:40.779
"I'll look for another acorn."

15
00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:51.883
Kip went to the playground.

16
00:01:51.884 --> 00:01:56.051
He saw acorns on the steps.

17
00:01:56.052 --> 00:01:59.569
Kip climbed the first step.

18
00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:10.534
He found a cracked acorn.

19
00:02:10.535 --> 00:02:15.003
Kip climbed to the next step.

20
00:02:15.004 --> 00:02:18.210
He found a moldy acorn.

21
00:02:18.211 --> 00:02:23.318
"Eww!" said Kip.

22
00:02:23.319 --> 00:02:38.112
Kip climbed to the top of the steps.

23
00:02:38.113 --> 00:02:40.413
He stood on the bridge.

24
00:02:40.414 --> 00:02:46.852
But there were no more perfect acorns.

25
00:02:46.853 --> 00:02:50.576
This was a horrible day!

